# =============================================================================
# Hermit AlfaClub Creative Agent — Railway Service Env (hermit.4626.fun)
# =============================================================================
# This is the dedicated lightweight service for /hermit /gmeow /meme + room 1659
# theatrical marketing injection (Hyperliquid + on-chain FriendKey curve + AlfaClub PnL).
#
# It is SEPARATE from the main Keepr primary XMTP service.
# Do NOT copy the full Keepr primary env here — only the vars below matter.
#
# After editing, load with:
#   env $(cat hermit-railway.env | xargs) pnpm agent:railway-hermit-doctor
#
# Then paste the exact same values into Railway → hermit.4626.fun → Variables.
# =============================================================================

# --- REQUIRED: Database (alfaclub stores are imported early by the bridge) ---
# Use the same Supabase pooler you use for the Keepr primary.
# Transaction mode (6543) is usually fine for this service.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.XXXX:YOUR_PASSWORD@aws-0-us-west-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?sslmode=require

# --- REQUIRED: AlfaClub chat auth (the bridge will 401-spam without this) ---
# Option A (simpler, short-lived): paste a fresh JWT from your browser devtools
#   when logged into AlfaClub as the bot identity.
# Option B (better, self-healing): provide the Privy refresh triplet.
# The in-process refresher will write the identity token into alfaclub_runtime_secret.
ALFACLUB_CHAT_JWT=

# If you want auto-rotation (recommended for a long-lived Railway service):
ALFACLUB_CHAT_PRIVY_ACCESS_TOKEN=
ALFACLUB_CHAT_PRIVY_REFRESH_TOKEN=

# Optional but useful for the refresher:
ALFACLUB_PRIVY_APP_ID=cmk2k53f101jkl70cw44uib7x
ALFACLUB_PRIVY_ORIGIN=https://alfaclub.app

# --- STRONGLY RECOMMENDED: Hermit creative brain (first-party /api/hermit/draft via AI Gateway) ---
HERMIT_AGENT_CHAT_ENDPOINT=https://app.4626.fun/api/hermit/draft
HERMIT_AGENT_BEARER_TOKEN=...

# --- Room targeting (full Hermit ability on all watcher rooms) ---
# ALFACLUB_CHAT_ROOM_ID must stay a single numeric primary room.
ALFACLUB_CHAT_ROOM_ID=1043
# Slash-command rooms (/hermit /gmeow /meme /help /alfa + arena when enabled):
ALFACLUB_HERMIT_COMMAND_ROOMS=2,1043,1484,1659,1660
# Opinion-watch / inverse-AKITA reaction rooms (may overlap command rooms):
ALFACLUB_INVERSE_AKITA_CHAT_REACTION_ROOM_IDS=1484,1660,2,1043,1659
# Durable opinion-trade capture/reconciliation is Railway-owned and default-off
# for phased rollout. Journal analysis/dispatch is Vercel-owned, so publication
# must remain off on this service.
ALFACLUB_INVERSE_OPINION_TRADE_CAPTURE_ENABLED=0
ALFACLUB_INVERSE_AKITA_TRADE_JOURNAL_PUBLISH_ENABLED=0
# Optional; defaults to 120000 and is clamped to at least 30000.
# ALFACLUB_INVERSE_OPINION_RECONCILER_INTERVAL_MS=120000
# Hermit operator / arena room gates (empty HERMIT_ALLOWED_ROOM_IDS = allow all):
HERMIT_ALLOWED_ROOM_IDS=2,1043,1484,1659,1660
ARENA_ALLOWED_ROOM_IDS=2,1043,1484,1659,1660

# --- Optional but nice for observability ---
# Railway sets PORT for you. Default in code is 8080.
# PORT=8080

# --- Optional: control bridge behaviour ---
# ALFACLUB_CHAT_BRIDGE_ENABLED=true
# ALFACLUB_CHAT_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=6000
# ALFACLUB_CHAT_HISTORY_LIMIT=20

# The following are usually NOT needed on the pure Hermit creative service
# (they belong on the Keepr primary or Vercel cron surfaces):
# - AGENT_RUNTIME_ROLE
# - AGENT_CONSUME_XMTP
# - XMTP_*
# - PRIVY_WALLET_* (server agent wallets)
# - Full Privy app secret (only the chat-specific ones above)

# After setting on Railway, trigger a redeploy.
# Success signal in logs: look for the block starting with
#   [hermit][early] === HERMIT RAILWAY DIAGNOSTICS ===
# The SUMMARY line should say the core requirements are satisfied.
#
# Once healthy, test in AlfaClub room 1659 with:
#   /gmeow
#   /hermit what's the liquidation distance on the 1659 short?
#
# The response should contain live Hyperliquid + on-chain curve data.